---
layout: base.njk
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Joe的个人小站 | 主页"
description: "欢迎来到Joe的个人网站！这里有角色介绍、技术博客、友情链接和网盘入口。探索Joe的创作世界。"
keywords: "Joe, Furry, 个人网站, 博客, Blog, OC介绍, 技术分享, 友情链接"
canonical: "https://furryjoe.site/"
pageTitle: "JoE's Site"
bodyClass: "home-page"
hideHomeBtn: true
styles:
  - /css/html-style/index.css
  - /css/animations/animation-index.css
  - /css/mobile-adaption.css
inlineHead: |
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "Joe的个人小站",
    "description": "Joe的个人网站 - 角色介绍、技术博客、笔记分享",
    "url": "https://furryjoe.site/",
    "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": "Joe" }
  }
  </script>
  <script>
    // 首页只额外等一张立绘：宽屏用横图，竖屏用竖图。
    window.pageResources = [window.matchMedia('(max-width: 768px)').matches
        ? '/images/backgrounds/bkg-v.png'
        : '/images/backgrounds/bkg-h.png'];
  </script>
headScripts:
  - /js/index.js
---
<main class="home-poster" id="home_poster">
    <aside class="home-directory" aria-label="探索小站">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">EXPLORE / JOE</p>
        {% include "partials/nav.njk" %}
    </aside>

    <section class="home-intro" aria-labelledby="welcome_message_2">
        <div class="home-copy">
            <span class="home-panel-surface panel-background" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <button type="button" class="home-menu-trigger cyber-control" id="home_menu_trigger"
                aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="home_menu" aria-expanded="false">探索小站 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
            <p class="home-welcome" id="welcome_message_1">你好，欢迎来到</p>
            <h2 class="home-headline" id="welcome_message_2">我的世界</h2>
            <p class="home-caption">角色 · 创作 · 生活</p>
        </div>
        <nav class="home-socials" id="link_column" aria-label="站外链接">
            {% for social in site.socials %}
            <a class="home-social-link cyber-control" href="{{ social.url }}" aria-label="{{ social.label }}"
                title="{{ social.label }}">
                <span class="home-social-icon" aria-hidden="true"
                    style="--social-icon: url('{{ social.icon }}');"></span>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}
            <span class="home-panel-surface panel-background" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </nav>
    </section>
</main>

<dialog class="home-menu cyber-frame" id="home_menu" aria-labelledby="home_menu_title">
    <div class="home-menu-header">
        <h2 id="home_menu_title">探索小站</h2>
        <form method="dialog"><button class="home-menu-close cyber-control" aria-label="关闭导航">关闭 ×</button></form>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/nav.njk" %}
</dialog>

<script>initializeHomePage();</script>
